## 2. Schéma Relationnel de la Base de Données  

| Table | PK | FK | Colonnes principales | Relation |
|-------|----|----|----------------------|----------|
| `users` | `id` (UUID) | – | `email`, `hashed_pwd`, `created_at` | 1‑N → `dashboards` |
| `dashboards` | `id` (UUID) | `user_id` → `users.id` | `name`, `layout`, `created_at` | 1‑N → `widgets` |
| `widgets` | `id` (UUID) | `dashboard_id` → `dashboards.id` | `type`, `config_json`, `position`, `created_at` | 1‑N → `widget_history` |
| `widget_history` | `id` (UUID) | `widget_id` → `widgets.id` | `snapshot_json`, `timestamp` | – |
| `saved_widgets` | `id` (UUID) | `user_id` → `users.id` | `type`, `config_json`, `created_at` | – |
| `ai_sessions` | `id` (UUID) | `user_id` → `users.id` | `started_at`, `ended_at` | 1‑N → `ai_queries` |
| `ai_queries` | `id` (UUID) | `session_id` → `ai_sessions.id` | `prompt`, `sql_generated`, `response_json`, `duration_ms` | – |
| `rate_limits` | `user_id` (UUID) | – | `window_start`, `counter` | – |
| `pines_vectors` *(Pinecone collection, non‑relational)* | – | – | `vector_id`, `metadata_json` | – |

**Relations clés**  
- `users.id` 1‑N `dashboards.user_id`  
- `dashboards.id` 1‑N `widgets.dashboard_id`  
- `widgets.id` 1‑N `widget_history.widget_id`  
- `users.id` 1‑N `saved_widgets.user_id`  
- `users.id` 1‑N `ai_sessions.user_id`  
- `ai_sessions.id` 1‑N `ai_queries.session_id`  

