## 3. Architecture Backend & APIs  

### API Families  
- **REST** – CRUD sur `users`, `dashboards`, `widgets`, `saved_widgets`.  
- **WebSocket** – Canal `ws://…/chat` pour streaming IA (token‑by‑token).  
- **SSE (option)** – Endpoint `/stream/sql` (fallback).  

### Routers / Contrôleurs (FastAPI)  
| Router | Endpoint(s) | Contrôleur | Service(s) appelés |
|--------|-------------|------------|--------------------|
| `auth_router` | `/auth/login`, `/auth/refresh` | `AuthController` | `AuthService`, `JWTService` |
| `user_router` | `/users/*` | `UserController` | `UserService` |
| `dashboard_router` | `/dashboards/*` | `DashboardController` | `DashboardService` |
| `widget_router` | `/widgets/*` | `WidgetController` | `WidgetService`, `ExportService` |
| `saved_widget_router` | `/saved-widgets/*` | `SavedWidgetController` | `SavedWidgetService` |
| `chat_router` | `/chat/ws` (WebSocket) | `ChatController` | `ChatService`, `LLMService`, `SQLGenService`, `RateLimitService` |
| `sql_router` | `/sql/generate` (POST) | `SQLController` | `SQLGenService`, `SecurityService` |
| `rate_limit_router` | `/rate-limit/*` | `RateLimitController` | `RateLimitService` |
| `monitor_router` | `/metrics` | – | Prometheus exporter |

### Services (Business Logic)  
- `AuthService` – vérification credentials, création JWT.  
- `UserService` – gestion profil, récupération.  
- `DashboardService` – création, mise à jour, suppression.  
- `WidgetService` – persistance, génération dynamique, validation JSON.  
- `SavedWidgetService` – épinglage, liste personnelle.  
- `ChatService` – orchestration du dialogue, gestion session IA.  
- `LLMService` – appel OpenAI, tool‑calling, filtrage PII.  
- `SQLGenService` – conversion LLM → SQL, validation syntaxe, timeout (5 s).  
- `SecurityService` – exécution SQL via rôle `nexus_reader`, sandbox.  
- `RateLimitService` – token bucket dans Redis (50 req/h/user).  
- `ExportService` – sérialisation widget, téléchargement CSV/PNG.  
- `VectorSearchService` – requêtes Pinecone pour RAG.  

